238 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When internal signals are absent\054 ambiguity isn\031t a failure\054 it\031s the landscape\056 Strategic executives are used to navigating fuzziness\054 but they need help seeing where and why certainty breaks down\056 Yet in some contexts \050e\056g\056\054 board alignment\054 crisis comms\051\054 surfacing ambiguity can undermine confidence\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240narrative clarity and transparent terrain\055mapping\056\n\nConclusion\055first compresses complexity into action\056 Reasoning\055first opens space for interpretation and shared sensemaking\056 The right posture depends on what the moment demands \055 alignment\054 or exploration\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 239 0 R
     /Pg 232 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
